 - `solaros.storage`: `status`, `is_mounted`, `mount`, `unmount`, `mount_point`,
-  `usage`, `resolve`, `stat`, `exists`, `scandir`, `read_file`, `rescan`,
+  `usage`, `resolve`, `stat`, `exists`, `scandir`, `read_file`, `write_file`, `rescan`,
